WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.008 --> 00:00:01.374
IT.

00:00:01.375 --> 00:00:05.578
EVEN IF THEY DID, IT'S IMMORAL

00:00:05.579 --> 00:00:06.346
STILL.

00:00:06.347 --> 00:00:09.983
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WE HAVE A BISHOP IN

00:00:09.984 --> 00:00:12.885
THE UNITED METHODIST CHURCH.

00:00:12.886 --> 00:00:14.320
THANKS FOR COMING ON.

00:00:14.321 --> 00:00:15.021
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.

00:00:15.022 --> 00:00:16.656
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I DON'T KNOW IF YOU

00:00:16.657 --> 00:00:19.292
SAW THE INTERVIEW WE JUST DID

00:00:19.293 --> 00:00:22.228
WITH MR. LOPEZ AS AN ELECTED

00:00:22.229 --> 00:00:23.396
MUNICIPAL LEADER IN TIJUANA.

00:00:23.397 --> 00:00:25.565
HE DESCRIBED THE SCENE AND WE

00:00:25.566 --> 00:00:27.033
HAVE PICTURES WHERE HUNDREDS OF

00:00:27.034 --> 00:00:28.635
THOUSANDS ARE LIVING IN THE OPEN

00:00:28.636 --> 00:00:28.901
AIR.

00:00:28.902 --> 00:00:30.570
THE CITY OF TIJUANA IS BEING

00:00:30.571 --> 00:00:31.271
DISRUPTED BY THIS.

00:00:31.272 --> 00:00:33.306
SCHOOLS HAVE CLOSED, ARRESTS

00:00:33.307 --> 00:00:34.173
HAVE BEEN MADE.

00:00:34.174 --> 00:00:35.742
FOR SOME IN CASES SERIOUS

00:00:35.743 --> 00:00:36.075
CRIMES.

00:00:36.076 --> 00:00:38.511
HE SAID THE RECENTLY RELIGIOUS

00:00:38.512 --> 00:00:40.747
LEADERS CAME TO THE MIGRANT

00:00:40.748 --> 00:00:42.448
ENCAMPMENT AND ENCOURAGED THEM

00:00:42.449 --> 00:00:46.753
TO STAY IN TENTS IN THE MIDDLE

00:00:46.754 --> 00:00:47.420
OF TIJUANA.

00:00:47.421 --> 00:00:48.621
WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF THAT?

00:00:48.622 --> 00:00:51.624
&gt;&gt; I'M AWARE THAT RELIGIOUS

00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:54.394
LEADERS, AMONG THEM, METHODIST

00:00:54.395 --> 00:00:56.429
FROM THE METHODIST CHURCH OF

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.531
MEXICO HAVE BEEN COMPASSIONATELY

00:00:58.532 --> 00:01:00.933
FEEDING THE MIGRANTS.

00:01:00.934 --> 00:01:02.902
I'VE SEEN THEM, I KNOW THEIR

00:01:02.903 --> 00:01:03.236
PLIGHT.

00:01:03.237 --> 00:01:04.370
THEY'RE MIGRANTS THAT HAVE LEFT

00:01:04.371 --> 00:01:05.004
THEIR HOME.

00:01:05.005 --> 00:01:06.839
NOT BECAUSE THEY WANTED TO LEAVE

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:08.074
THEIR HOMES BUT BECAUSE THAT

00:01:08.075 --> 00:01:10.677
THEY -- POVERTY AND GREAT

00:01:10.678 --> 00:01:11.044
VIOLENCE.

00:01:11.045 --> 00:01:13.646
SO THEY MIGRATED.

00:01:13.647 --> 00:01:17.817
THEY HAVE A RIGHT TO MIGRATE AND

00:01:17.818 --> 00:01:21.321
A RIGHT FOR DUE PROCESS FOR

00:01:21.322 --> 00:01:21.688
ASYLUM.

00:01:21.689 --> 00:01:23.589
THESE ARE PEOPLE THAT NEED

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:26.659
HUMANITY TO EXTEND COMPASSION TO

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:27.393
THEM.

00:01:27.394 --> 00:01:29.262
LOVE AND CARE.

00:01:29.263 --> 00:01:31.064
IT MAY DISCOMFORT SOME, BUT THIS

00:01:31.065 --> 00:01:32.999
IS A MOMENT IN WHICH WE CAN SHOW

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.001
THE BEST OF HUMANITY.

00:01:35.002 --> 00:01:37.370
I'M NOT AWARE OF WHAT WAS JUST

00:01:37.371 --> 00:01:37.737
DESCRIBED.

00:01:37.738 --> 00:01:40.106
YOU SHOWED PICTURES.

00:01:40.107 --> 00:01:41.441
I DIDN'T SEE THEM.

00:01:41.442 --> 00:01:42.909
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT'S -- RIGHT.

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.544
SO ARE WE.

00:01:44.545 --> 00:01:46.379
OUR HEART GOES OUT TO ANYBODY

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.014
THAT WALKS A GREAT DISTANCE TO

00:01:48.015 --> 00:01:49.916
GET A BETTER LIFE.

00:01:49.917 --> 00:01:56.889
I ALWAYS ASSUMED THAT MOST

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:59.325
MIGRANTS ARE DECENT PEOPLE.

00:01:59.326 --> 00:02:00.993
BUT THERE'S A COST TO THE UNITED

00:02:00.994 --> 00:02:03.262
STATES CITIZENS TO EVERY PERSON

00:02:03.263 --> 00:02:03.830
THAT COMES HERE.

00:02:03.831 --> 00:02:05.898
THE COST IS HUNDREDS OF

00:02:05.899 --> 00:02:07.900
THOUSANDS PER IMMIGRANT OVER A

00:02:07.901 --> 00:02:08.267
LIFETIME.

00:02:08.268 --> 00:02:09.936
THE METHODIST CHURCH IS NOT

00:02:09.937 --> 00:02:10.470
PAYING THAT BILL.

00:02:10.471 --> 00:02:12.071
U.S. TAXPAYERS ARE.

00:02:12.072 --> 00:02:14.674
SO I WONDER IF THAT'S A FACTOR

00:02:14.675 --> 00:02:15.408
IN YOUR CONSIDERATION.

00:02:15.409 --> 00:02:16.943
SHOULDN'T YOU BE PAYING FOR THE

00:02:16.944 --> 00:02:18.811
PEOPLE THAT YOU ENCOURAGE TO

00:02:18.812 --> 00:02:19.479
COME HERE?

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:20.913
WHY AREN'T YOU?

00:02:20.914 --> 00:02:23.116
&gt;&gt; MIGRANTS ARE NOT COSTING THIS

00:02:23.117 --> 00:02:24.817
COUNTRY IN THE WAY THAT YOU

00:02:24.818 --> 00:02:25.184
DESCRIBE.

00:02:25.185 --> 00:02:27.153
THESE MIGRANTS THAT COME TO THIS

00:02:27.154 --> 00:02:30.289
COUNTRY ARE CONTRIBUTING TO OUR

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:31.591
SOCIETY.

00:02:31.592 --> 00:02:32.825
ACTUALLY THEY'RE CONTRIBUTING TO

00:02:32.826 --> 00:02:33.926
THE ECONOMIC BASE.

00:02:33.927 --> 00:02:37.897
MANY OF THEM ARE PAYING TO OUR

00:02:37.898 --> 00:02:39.532
SOCIAL SECURITY AND DON'T

00:02:39.533 --> 00:02:40.433
BENEFIT FROM THAT SOCIAL

00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:41.634
SECURITY, MONEY THAT THEY'RE

00:02:41.635 --> 00:02:42.068
CONTRIBUTING.

00:02:42.069 --> 00:02:44.670
MANY ARE WORKING TWO AND THREE

00:02:44.671 --> 00:02:44.971
JOBS.

00:02:44.972 --> 00:02:46.873
I'VE LIVED AND SERVED IN TEXAS

00:02:46.874 --> 00:02:49.909
AND ALL ACROSS THE SOUTHWEST AND

00:02:49.910 --> 00:02:51.144
THE WEST.

00:02:51.145 --> 00:02:54.046
THESE FOLKS CONTRIBUTE MORE,

00:02:54.047 --> 00:02:56.315
MUCH MORE THAN THEY RECEIVE FROM

00:02:56.316 --> 00:02:57.583
OUR --

00:02:57.584 --> 00:02:58.618
&gt;&gt; Tucker: JUST AS A

00:02:58.619 --> 00:03:00.052
MATHEMATICAL -- HOLD ON.

00:03:00.053 --> 00:03:01.454
AS A MATHEMATICAL QUESTION,

00:03:01.455 --> 00:03:03.256
THAT'S NOT TRUE.

00:03:03.257 --> 00:03:04.357
I THINK THERE'S A GREAT MORAL

00:03:04.358 --> 00:03:06.292
CONTRIBUTION OF POOR IMMIGRANTS.

00:03:06.293 --> 00:03:08.528
I'M NOT ATTACKING THEM

00:03:08.529 --> 00:03:09.562
PERSONALLY.

00:03:09.563 --> 00:03:10.296
I HOLD NO ANIMUS TOWARDS THEM.

00:03:10.297 --> 00:03:12.031
A STUDY HAS BEEN DONE ON IT AND

00:03:12.032 --> 00:03:13.866
PEOPLE COME WITH LESS THAN A

00:03:13.867 --> 00:03:15.234
HIGH SCHOOL EDUCATION, TAKE MORE

00:03:15.235 --> 00:03:17.637
SERVICES BY A HUGE MARGIN THAN

00:03:17.638 --> 00:03:18.638
THEY PAY INTO THE SYSTEM.

00:03:18.639 --> 00:03:20.873
NOW, YOU DON'T PAY ANY TAXES IN

00:03:20.874 --> 00:03:22.074
YOUR CHURCH BECAUSE YOU HAVE A

00:03:22.075 --> 00:03:23.576
TAX EXEMPTION.

00:03:23.577 --> 00:03:25.077
THE REST OF US WORK FOR

00:03:25.078 --> 00:03:26.279
COMPANIES THAT PAY TAXES.

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:28.748
WE'RE SUPPORTING THE POLICIES

00:03:28.749 --> 00:03:29.282
YOU'RE ENCOURAGING.

00:03:29.283 --> 00:03:32.185
WHY IS IT VIRTUOUS OF YOU TO DO

00:03:32.186 --> 00:03:32.485
THAT?

00:03:32.486 --> 00:03:35.021
IF YOU'RE ENCOURAGING PEOPLE TO

00:03:35.022 --> 00:03:37.123
COME HERE, WHY DON'T YOU HAVE AN

00:03:37.124 --> 00:03:39.125
OBLIGATION TO PROVIDE EDUCATION,

00:03:39.126 --> 00:03:41.327
HOUSING, FOOD, MEDICAL BUT YOU

00:03:41.328 --> 00:03:42.328
OFFER IT ON TO TAXPAYERS?

00:03:42.329 --> 00:03:45.832
WHY IS THAT A CHRISTIAN THING TO

00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:46.699
DO?

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:54.740
&gt;&gt; THE UNITED METHODIST --

00:03:54.741 --> 00:04:00.480
&gt;&gt; YOUR CHURCH HAS A TAX

00:04:00.481 --> 00:04:00.847
EXEMPTION.

00:04:00.848 --> 00:04:03.015
&gt;&gt; OUR PEOPLE PAY INTO OUR

00:04:03.016 --> 00:04:04.817
SYSTEM AND THEY CONTRIBUTE TO

00:04:04.818 --> 00:04:06.652
THE ECONOMIC VIABILITY OF OUR

00:04:06.653 --> 00:04:06.986
COUNTRY.

00:04:06.987 --> 00:04:10.456
I LIVE AND SERVE IN THE STATE OF

00:04:10.457 --> 00:04:10.857
CALIFORNIA.

00:04:10.858 --> 00:04:14.227
THE ECONOMIC AGRICULTURAL BASE

00:04:14.228 --> 00:04:16.028
OF CALIFORNIA WOULD JUST

00:04:16.029 --> 00:04:19.198
DIMINISH IF NOT BE TOTALLY

00:04:19.199 --> 00:04:19.899
UNDERMINED IF IT WASN'T FOR

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.034
THESE MIGRANTS --

00:04:22.035 --> 00:04:23.069
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOLD ON.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.771
SINCE YOU'RE A PERSON OF GOD --

00:04:25.772 --> 00:04:28.741
&gt;&gt; PEOPLE IN THIS COUNTRY WON'T

00:04:28.742 --> 00:04:29.742
TAKE ON --

00:04:29.743 --> 00:04:31.110
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YEAH BUT -- OKAY.

00:04:31.111 --> 00:04:33.513
YOU'RE ON THE SIDE OF EMPLOYERS

00:04:33.514 --> 00:04:35.081
THAT WANT TO PAY THIRD WORLD

00:04:35.082 --> 00:04:36.048
WAGES TO THEIR WORKERS.

00:04:36.049 --> 00:04:37.450
THAT'S WHERE YOU ARE IN THIS

00:04:37.451 --> 00:04:37.817
QUESTION.

00:04:37.818 --> 00:04:39.619
I WANT TO ASK YOU A THEOLOGICAL

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:40.219
QUESTION --

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:41.821
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT ON THE SIDE OF

00:04:41.822 --> 00:04:43.022
EMPLOYERS --

00:04:43.023 --> 00:04:44.891
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU'RE ON THE SIDE --

00:04:44.892 --> 00:04:47.460
&gt;&gt; WHO ARE WILLING TO PAY

00:04:47.461 --> 00:04:48.160
LESS --

00:04:48.161 --> 00:04:50.363
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OF BIG ACC CULTURAL

00:04:50.364 --> 00:04:50.897
COMPANIES --

00:04:50.898 --> 00:04:52.899
&gt;&gt; THE ECONOMIC STUDIES I'M

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:53.799
READING ARE DIFFERENT FROM THE

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:55.101
ONES THAT YOU ARE QUOTING.

00:04:55.102 --> 00:04:56.502
&gt;&gt; Tucker: LET ME ASK YOU A

00:04:56.503 --> 00:04:57.103
THEOLOGICAL QUESTION.

00:04:57.104 --> 00:05:00.072
THAT IS YOUR AREA OF EXPERTISE.

00:05:00.073 --> 00:05:02.475
IF I FORCE YOU TO PUT MONEY IN

00:05:02.476 --> 00:05:04.544
THE COLLECTION PLATE IN MY NAME,

00:05:04.545 --> 00:05:06.078
WHICH IS WHAT YOU'RE DOING, WITH

00:05:06.079 --> 00:05:08.981
U.S. TAXPAYERS, DO I GET THE

00:05:08.982 --> 00:05:12.318
CREDIT FROM GOD FOR DONATING TO

00:05:12.319 --> 00:05:15.621
THE CHURCH?

00:05:15.622 --> 00:05:17.223
IN OTHER WORDS, WHY DON'T YOU AS

00:05:17.224 --> 00:05:18.624
A CHURCH MAKE CERTAIN THAT EVERY

00:05:18.625 --> 00:05:20.560
PERSON THAT YOU ENCOURAGE TO

00:05:20.561 --> 00:05:22.862
COME HERE IS FED AND HOUSED AND

00:05:22.863 --> 00:05:25.064
EDUCATED AND HEALED AT YOUR

00:05:25.065 --> 00:05:25.398
EXPENSE?

00:05:25.399 --> 00:05:26.532
HOW CAN YOU FEEL VIRTUOUS WHEN

00:05:26.533 --> 00:05:28.067
YOU'RE NOT PAYING FOR THE THINGS

00:05:28.068 --> 00:05:31.203
THAT YOU'RE ENCOURAGING?

00:05:31.204 --> 00:05:32.605
I DON'T UNDERSTAND.

00:05:32.606 --> 00:05:34.106
&gt;&gt; FIRST OF ALL, WE'RE NOT INCUR

00:05:34.107 --> 00:05:36.008
EDGE ARING PEOPLE TO COME.

00:05:36.009 --> 00:05:37.877
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YES, YOU ARE.

00:05:37.878 --> 00:05:39.579
&gt;&gt; WE'RE TRYING TO HELP THEM

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:39.879
STAY.

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.814
WHEN THEY COME BECAUSE THEY HAVE

00:05:41.815 --> 00:05:44.083
HIT A DESPERATE PLACE IN THEIR

00:05:44.084 --> 00:05:45.985
LIVES, WE'RE GOING TO CARE FOR

00:05:45.986 --> 00:05:47.620
THEM, SEEK JUSTICE FOR THEM,

00:05:47.621 --> 00:05:49.121
GOING TO ASK FOR --

00:05:49.122 --> 00:05:51.290
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DO YOU PAY FOR THEIR

00:05:51.291 --> 00:05:52.358
MEDICAL EXPENSES?

00:05:52.359 --> 00:05:52.959
ANY OF THEM?

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:54.060
I DON'T THINK YOU DO.

00:05:54.061 --> 00:05:55.494
&gt;&gt; WE DO.

00:05:55.495 --> 00:05:56.062
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU TO?

00:05:56.063 --> 00:05:57.763
HOW MUCH DO YOU SPEND A YEAR?

00:05:57.764 --> 00:05:59.932
&gt;&gt; WE CARE FOR HOUSING, WE CARE

00:05:59.933 --> 00:06:00.933
FOR THEIR CARE.

00:06:00.934 --> 00:06:03.336
WE SPEND MILLIONS OF DOLLARS AS

00:06:03.337 --> 00:06:04.637
UNITED METHODIST AND WE'RE NOT

00:06:04.638 --> 00:06:06.906
THE ONLY ONES.

00:06:06.907 --> 00:06:08.474
THE CATHOLIC CHURCH --

00:06:08.475 --> 00:06:09.909
&gt;&gt; Tucker: AMERICAN TAXPAYERS

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:11.410
SPEND $135 BILLION ON THIS.

00:06:11.411 --> 00:06:13.279
IF YOU'RE GOING TO ENCOURAGE

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.347
PEOPLE, YOU SHOULD PITCH IN MORE

00:06:14.348 --> 00:06:16.082
THAN YOU ARE.

00:06:16.083 --> 00:06:18.050
THEN YOU CAN CALL IT VIRTUE.

00:06:18.051 --> 00:06:18.417
&gt;&gt; Dana:

00:06:18.418 --> 00:06:20.620
&gt;&gt; WE DO PITCH IN TO CARE FOR

00:06:20.621 --> 00:06:25.559
THEM IN WAYS BEYOND YOUR

